    "body": "Preserve the verified package mapping during ordinary Parties startup so the public catalog reader's dynamic project-version evaluations survive preflight. Missing or changed proof, altered inputs and another workspace still refuse before composition effects.\n\nSource: `4afa0421794f7e6f3fcbd5d84664eae206e9daa5`.\nBuilds source and published tool: `fc2122240a39f03628c04fa8433e5eece90b8b4c`, version `4.44.3`.\n\nThe [exact-source tuple preflight](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Platform/actions/runs/42030769896) passed all 347 required cases. The [catalog builder consumer binding](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Platform/actions/runs/42030770351) also passed.\n\nThis release supplies the genuine versioned Platform identity needed by downstream package preparation. Parties still requires its own uninstrumented exact-source runtime CI and publication checks; no production deployment is performed by this release.\n"
  },
